Unleashed-Pi — Private Unleashed 2.0 Sub-GHz toolkit for Raspberry Pi
Copyright (c) 2026 — released for cybersecurity education and research.

Based on concepts and protocols of the "Private Unleashed 2.0 / Quantum FW"
Flipper Zero firmware family and the public Unleashed firmware
(DarkFlippers) protocol implementations, ported with permission-free,
documented public protocols (HCS301 KeeLoq, PT-2260/Princeton, CAME,
Nice FLO, TI CC1101).

